comment = "Hardware telemetry with OpenTelemetry output"

desc = <<EOD
hwtlm collects CPU power consumption (Intel RAPL), per-core
temperatures, frequencies, C-state residency, ACPI thermal zones,
and GPU state, and ships the results as text, JSONL, or OTLP/HTTP
metrics to an OpenTelemetry collector.  The sysctl-based sensors are
architecture-independent; RAPL power data requires an Intel CPU and
cpuctl(4).
EOD
